usage: evidence.py [-h] --feature FEATURE [--protect PROTECT]
                   {allocate,register} ...

Development-only evidence routing and registration; no review/deletion
authority. Public interface: ``python -m ticket_harness.evidence --help``.
Producers own allocated payloads; this helper owns capture metadata under a
directory flock. Review tools must acquire that same lock before updating
review namespaces.

positional arguments:
  {allocate,register}
    allocate           Select and reserve a unique producer destination
    register           Register existing payload bytes and observed facts

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
  --feature FEATURE
  --protect PROTECT    Active approved-input/frozen path or subtree; repeat as
                       needed
